{"n":16,"level":"A1","title":"What time is it?","pt":"Que horas são?","scene":"station","tod":"day","cast":["Raj","Emma","Mia"],"fic":{"scene":"station","tod":"day","decor":[],"cast":[{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#f08a4b","hair":"black","skin":"brown","arms":"wave"}},{"p":{"hs":"ponytail","outfit":"shirt","top":"#e8473b","hair":"blond","skin":"light","arms":"point"}},{"p":{"hs":"pigtails","outfit":"dress","top":"#4a90d9","hair":"black","skin":"brown","arms":"out"}}]},"minutes":64,"slides":[{"t":"cover","min":1,"title":"What time is it?","pt":"Que horas são?","level":"A1","n":16,"cast":["Raj","Emma","Mia"]},{"t":"goals","min":1,"goal":"Perguntar e dizer as horas em pontos e meias horas.","canDo":["Perguntar What time is it?","Dizer horas cheias, e meia, e quinze","Usar a.m. e p.m."]},{"t":"warm","min":2,"q":"Que horas são agora? Quando você acorda?","pt":"Treine só as horas cheias.","chips":["What time is it?","It's three o'clock.","It's half past four.","It's a quarter to six."]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"O relógio de 12 e de 24 horas","text":"Nos EUA e no Reino Unido, as pessoas falam 'seven p.m.' (19h). Em trens e aeroportos aparece o formato de 24 horas. 'Quarter past' é quinze depois, 'half past' é trinta depois.","kind":"Você sabia?"},{"t":"scene","min":1,"text":"Na estação de trem, Raj olha o relógio. Ele e Emma precisam saber a hora do trem.","line":"Excuse me, what time is it?","who":["Raj","Emma","Mia"]},{"t":"article","min":2,"title":"Don't miss the train","text":"Raj has a train at eight o'clock. It is half past seven now. He is at the station with a coffee and a book. At a quarter to eight, the train is on the platform. Raj stands up and checks the board: platform four. He walks fast, but he is not late. He sits in a seat by the window and opens his book. The train leaves at eight on the dot. Raj smiles. In forty minutes he will be in the city.","pt":"Raj chega cedo, toma café e embarca no trem das oito.","qs":[{"q":"Que horas são no i